        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 59590,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello team. Kicking off our work on the Unified Self-Service Support Portal. The primary goal is a focused MVP within 30 days to start deflecting inbound calls. I've created a draft scope document, A1, to formalize this. Please review the proposed feature set for T1. The main question is: what is essential for day one?",
