          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 75507,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Agreed on search. For the MVP, should we also include a 'Top 5 FAQs' section on the homepage? It could help surface the most common issues immediately, even before a user searches.",
